      "en": "After these things I looked, and the temple of the tabernacle of the testimony in heaven was opened.",
      "ko": "또 이 일 후에 내가 보니 하늘에 증거 장막의 성전이 열리며",
      "source_text_hash": "499866427a410944cf879e3102910965c06a17494351ac6b64f21f41376d720f",
      "translation_text_hash": "f0c9145f6cb706aeda57afddc140d199f5e4853ff1c7951c7f0ce46071166279",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
