      ],
      "en": "The temple was filled with smoke from the glory of God and from his power. No one was able to enter into the temple until the seven plagues of the seven angels would be finished.",
      "ko": "하나님의 영광과 능력을 인하여 성전에 연기가 차게 되매 일곱 천사의 일곱 재앙이 마치기까지는 성전에 능히 들어갈 자가 없더라",
      "source_text_hash": "54c28ad2ccea7acaeef6b47e6a0efcaa352a720ad04809c077b81e838df858d0",
      "translation_text_hash": "62be37dde5d51530e8e4fed065a6dbb9339e1a075cbaef1392a28efa8ce4a2f6",
